{
  "book": "alma",
  "bookName": "Alma",
  "chapter": 7,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 521.568,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 1.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 1.945,
      "end": 5.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seeing that I have been permitted to come unto you,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 5.283,
      "end": 8.348,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I attempt to address you in my language;",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 8.528,
      "end": 10.153,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, by my own mouth,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 10.333,
      "end": 12.469,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "seeing that it is the first time",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 12.649,
      "end": 15.9,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I have spoken unto you by the words of my mouth,",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 16.08,
      "end": 22.628,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I having been wholly confined to the judgment-seat, having had much business that I could not come unto you.",
      "verse": "7:1",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 23.308,
      "end": 26.605,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And even I could not have come now at this time",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 26.785,
      "end": 30.872,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "were it not that the judgment-seat hath been given to another,",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 31.052,
      "end": 32.538,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to reign in my stead;",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 32.718,
      "end": 36.898,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Lord in much mercy hath granted that I should come unto you.",
      "verse": "7:2",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 37.578,
      "end": 44.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, I have come having great hopes and much desire that I should find that ye had humbled yourselves before God,",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 44.863,
      "end": 48.392,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye had continued in the supplicating of his grace,",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 13
    },
    {
      "start": 48.572,
      "end": 51.683,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should find that ye were blameless before him,",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 51.863,
      "end": 55.625,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I should find that ye were not in the awful dilemma",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 55.805,
      "end": 58.406,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that our brethren were in at Zarahemla.",
      "verse": "7:3",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 59.086,
      "end": 61.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But blessed be the name of God,",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 61.356,
      "end": 63.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he hath given me to know,",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 63.765,
      "end": 71.242,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, hath given unto me the exceedingly great joy of knowing that they are established again in the way of his righteousness.",
      "verse": "7:4",
      "lineIndex": 19
    },
    {
      "start": 71.922,
      "end": 78.377,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I trust, according to the Spirit of God which is in me, that I shall also have joy over you;",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 78.557,
      "end": 86.266,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless I do not desire that my joy over you should come by the cause of so much afflictions and sorrow",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 86.446,
      "end": 89.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which I have had for the brethren at Zarahemla,",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 89.691,
      "end": 94.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, my joy cometh over them after wading through much affliction and sorrow.",
      "verse": "7:5",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 95.294,
      "end": 100.542,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I trust that ye are not in a state of so much unbelief as were your brethren;",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 100.722,
      "end": 104.159,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I trust that ye are not lifted up in the pride of your hearts;",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 104.339,
      "end": 109.262,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I trust that ye have not set your hearts upon riches and the vain things of the world;",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 109.442,
      "end": 112.275,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I trust that you do not worship idols,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 112.455,
      "end": 115.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but that ye do worship the true and the living God,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 116.025,
      "end": 121.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and that ye look forward for the remission of your sins, with an everlasting faith,",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 121.638,
      "end": 122.892,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which is to come.",
      "verse": "7:6",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 123.572,
      "end": 125.522,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For behold, I say unto you",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 125.702,
      "end": 127.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there be many things to come;",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 127.647,
      "end": 132.755,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and behold, there is one thing which is of more importance than they all\u2014",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 132.935,
      "end": 135.582,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, the time is not far distant",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 135.762,
      "end": 139.106,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the Redeemer liveth and cometh among his people.",
      "verse": "7:7",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 139.786,
      "end": 146.845,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I do not say that he will come among us at the time of his dwelling in his mortal tabernacle;",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 147.025,
      "end": 151.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, the Spirit hath not said unto me that this should be the case.",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 151.756,
      "end": 153.939,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now as to this thing I do not know;",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 154.119,
      "end": 161.364,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "but this much I do know, that the Lord God hath power to do all things which are according to his word.",
      "verse": "7:8",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 162.044,
      "end": 165.573,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, the Spirit hath said this much unto me, saying:",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 165.753,
      "end": 167.611,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Cry unto this people, saying\u2014",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 167.791,
      "end": 168.906,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Repent ye,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 169.086,
      "end": 171.176,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and prepare the way of the Lord,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 171.356,
      "end": 174.142,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and walk in his paths, which are straight;",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 174.322,
      "end": 177.248,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for behold, the kingdom of heaven is at hand,",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 177.428,
      "end": 180.725,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the Son of God cometh upon the face of the earth.",
      "verse": "7:9",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 181.405,
      "end": 183.82,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And behold, he shall be born of Mary,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 184.0,
      "end": 187.019,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "at Jerusalem which is the land of our forefathers,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 187.199,
      "end": 190.682,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "she being a virgin, a precious and chosen vessel,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 190.862,
      "end": 192.627,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who shall be overshadowed",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 192.807,
      "end": 195.454,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and conceive by the power of the Holy Ghost,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 195.634,
      "end": 197.259,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bring forth a son,",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 197.439,
      "end": 199.204,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, even the Son of God.",
      "verse": "7:10",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 199.884,
      "end": 201.463,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he shall go forth,",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 201.643,
      "end": 205.405,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "suffering pains and afflictions and temptations of every kind;",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 205.585,
      "end": 208.929,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and this that the word might be fulfilled which saith",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 209.109,
      "end": 213.056,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he will take upon him the pains and the sicknesses of his people.",
      "verse": "7:11",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 213.736,
      "end": 215.594,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he will take upon him death,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 215.774,
      "end": 219.443,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may loose the bands of death which bind his people;",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 219.623,
      "end": 222.224,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he will take upon him their infirmities,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 222.404,
      "end": 226.63,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that his bowels may be filled with mercy, according to the flesh,",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 226.81,
      "end": 232.383,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he may know according to the flesh how to succor his people according to their infirmities.",
      "verse": "7:12",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 233.063,
      "end": 235.339,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now the Spirit knoweth all things;",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 235.519,
      "end": 239.791,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless the Son of God suffereth according to the flesh",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 239.971,
      "end": 242.943,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might take upon him the sins of his people,",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 243.123,
      "end": 248.51,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he might blot out their transgressions according to the power of his deliverance;",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 248.69,
      "end": 252.312,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and now behold, this is the testimony which is in me.",
      "verse": "7:13",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 252.992,
      "end": 254.525,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Now I say unto you",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 254.705,
      "end": 256.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye must repent,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 256.603,
      "end": 258.228,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be born again;",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 258.408,
      "end": 260.08,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for the Spirit saith",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 260.26,
      "end": 261.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "if ye are not born again",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 262.112,
      "end": 264.48,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "ye cannot inherit the kingdom of heaven;",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 264.66,
      "end": 267.539,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore come and be baptized unto repentance,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 267.719,
      "end": 270.041,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may be washed from your sins,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 270.221,
      "end": 272.822,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may have faith on the Lamb of God,",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 273.002,
      "end": 280.432,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "who taketh away the sins of the world, who is mighty to save and to cleanse from all unrighteousness.",
      "verse": "7:14",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 281.112,
      "end": 282.552,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I say unto you",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 282.732,
      "end": 283.614,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "come",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 283.794,
      "end": 285.048,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and fear not,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 285.228,
      "end": 287.039,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and lay aside every sin,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 82
    },
    {
      "start": 287.219,
      "end": 289.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which easily doth beset you,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 289.582,
      "end": 292.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which doth bind you down to destruction,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 292.409,
      "end": 293.616,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, come",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 293.796,
      "end": 295.003,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and go forth,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 295.183,
      "end": 296.855,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and show unto your God",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 297.035,
      "end": 299.868,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye are willing to repent of your sins",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 300.048,
      "end": 304.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and enter into a covenant with him to keep his commandments,",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 304.268,
      "end": 309.376,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and witness it unto him this day by going into the waters of baptism.",
      "verse": "7:15",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 310.056,
      "end": 311.774,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And whosoever doeth this,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 311.954,
      "end": 315.158,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and keepeth the commandments of God from thenceforth,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 315.338,
      "end": 317.799,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "the same will remember that I say unto him,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 317.979,
      "end": 320.719,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, he will remember that I have said unto him,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 320.899,
      "end": 325.171,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he shall have eternal life, according to the testimony of the Holy Spirit,",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 325.351,
      "end": 327.209,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which testifieth in me.",
      "verse": "7:16",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 327.889,
      "end": 329.932,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 330.112,
      "end": 331.645,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "do you believe these things?",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 331.825,
      "end": 333.497,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I say unto you,",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 333.677,
      "end": 335.72,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I know that ye believe them;",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 335.9,
      "end": 338.733,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the way that I know that ye believe them",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 101
    },
    {
      "start": 338.913,
      "end": 342.164,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "is by the manifestation of the Spirit which is in me.",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 102
    },
    {
      "start": 342.344,
      "end": 345.455,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now because your faith is strong concerning that,",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 103
    },
    {
      "start": 345.635,
      "end": 349.304,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, concerning the things which I have spoken, great is my joy.",
      "verse": "7:17",
      "lineIndex": 104
    },
    {
      "start": 349.984,
      "end": 352.585,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For as I said unto you from the beginning,",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 105
    },
    {
      "start": 352.765,
      "end": 357.734,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I had much desire that ye were not in the state of dilemma like your brethren,",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 106
    },
    {
      "start": 357.914,
      "end": 361.351,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even so I have found that my desires have been gratified.",
      "verse": "7:18",
      "lineIndex": 107
    },
    {
      "start": 362.031,
      "end": 365.468,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For I perceive that ye are in the paths of righteousness;",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 108
    },
    {
      "start": 365.648,
      "end": 369.688,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I perceive that ye are in the path which leads to the kingdom of God;",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 109
    },
    {
      "start": 369.868,
      "end": 373.072,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, I perceive that ye are making his paths straight.",
      "verse": "7:19",
      "lineIndex": 110
    },
    {
      "start": 373.752,
      "end": 381.136,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I perceive that it has been made known unto you, by the testimony of his word, that he cannot walk in crooked paths;",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 111
    },
    {
      "start": 381.316,
      "end": 384.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither doth he vary from that which he hath said;",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 112
    },
    {
      "start": 384.654,
      "end": 388.926,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither hath he a shadow of turning from the right to the left,",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 113
    },
    {
      "start": 389.106,
      "end": 392.403,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or from that which is right to that which is wrong;",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 114
    },
    {
      "start": 392.583,
      "end": 395.091,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore, his course is one eternal round.",
      "verse": "7:20",
      "lineIndex": 115
    },
    {
      "start": 395.771,
      "end": 398.511,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he doth not dwell in unholy temples;",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 116
    },
    {
      "start": 398.691,
      "end": 402.128,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "neither can filthiness or anything which is unclean",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 117
    },
    {
      "start": 402.308,
      "end": 404.584,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "be received into the kingdom of God;",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 118
    },
    {
      "start": 404.764,
      "end": 407.597,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I say unto you the time shall come,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 119
    },
    {
      "start": 407.777,
      "end": 410.099,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, and it shall be at the last day,",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 120
    },
    {
      "start": 410.279,
      "end": 413.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that he who is filthy shall remain in his filthiness.",
      "verse": "7:21",
      "lineIndex": 121
    },
    {
      "start": 414.163,
      "end": 416.206,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 122
    },
    {
      "start": 416.386,
      "end": 418.615,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have said these things unto you",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 123
    },
    {
      "start": 418.795,
      "end": 421.953,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that I might awaken you to a sense of your duty to God,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 124
    },
    {
      "start": 422.133,
      "end": 424.269,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may walk blameless before him,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 125
    },
    {
      "start": 424.449,
      "end": 427.328,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may walk after the holy order of God,",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 126
    },
    {
      "start": 427.508,
      "end": 429.598,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "after which ye have been received.",
      "verse": "7:22",
      "lineIndex": 127
    },
    {
      "start": 430.278,
      "end": 432.786,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I would that ye should be humble,",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 128
    },
    {
      "start": 432.966,
      "end": 435.195,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and be submissive and gentle;",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 129
    },
    {
      "start": 435.375,
      "end": 437.093,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "easy to be entreated;",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 130
    },
    {
      "start": 437.273,
      "end": 439.92,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "full of patience and long-suffering;",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 131
    },
    {
      "start": 440.1,
      "end": 442.283,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being temperate in all things;",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 132
    },
    {
      "start": 442.463,
      "end": 446.457,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being diligent in keeping the commandments of God at all times;",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 133
    },
    {
      "start": 446.637,
      "end": 449.888,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "asking for whatsoever things ye stand in need,",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 134
    },
    {
      "start": 450.068,
      "end": 452.576,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "both spiritual and temporal;",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 135
    },
    {
      "start": 452.756,
      "end": 457.446,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "always returning thanks unto God for whatsoever things ye do receive.",
      "verse": "7:23",
      "lineIndex": 136
    },
    {
      "start": 458.126,
      "end": 461.423,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And see that ye have faith, hope, and charity,",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 137
    },
    {
      "start": 461.603,
      "end": 464.157,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and then ye will always abound in good works.",
      "verse": "7:24",
      "lineIndex": 138
    },
    {
      "start": 464.837,
      "end": 466.695,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And may the Lord bless you,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 139
    },
    {
      "start": 466.875,
      "end": 469.058,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and keep your garments spotless,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 140
    },
    {
      "start": 469.238,
      "end": 474.486,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that ye may at last be brought to sit down with Abraham, Isaac, and Jacob,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 141
    },
    {
      "start": 474.666,
      "end": 478.474,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the holy prophets who have been ever since the world began,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 142
    },
    {
      "start": 478.654,
      "end": 480.465,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "having your garments spotless",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 143
    },
    {
      "start": 480.645,
      "end": 482.967,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even as their garments are spotless,",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 144
    },
    {
      "start": 483.147,
      "end": 486.119,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "in the kingdom of heaven to go no more out.",
      "verse": "7:25",
      "lineIndex": 145
    },
    {
      "start": 486.799,
      "end": 488.842,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now my beloved brethren,",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 146
    },
    {
      "start": 489.022,
      "end": 494.548,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I have spoken these words unto you according to the Spirit which testifieth in me;",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 147
    },
    {
      "start": 494.728,
      "end": 499.697,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and my soul doth exceedingly rejoice, because of the exceeding diligence and heed",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 148
    },
    {
      "start": 499.877,
      "end": 502.292,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which ye have given unto my word.",
      "verse": "7:26",
      "lineIndex": 149
    },
    {
      "start": 502.972,
      "end": 505.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now, may the peace of God rest upon you,",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 150
    },
    {
      "start": 505.892,
      "end": 507.935,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon your houses and lands,",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 151
    },
    {
      "start": 508.115,
      "end": 510.298,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and upon your flocks and herds,",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 152
    },
    {
      "start": 510.478,
      "end": 511.964,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and all that you possess,",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 153
    },
    {
      "start": 512.144,
      "end": 518.088,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "your women and your children, according to your faith and good works, from this time forth and forever.",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 154
    },
    {
      "start": 518.268,
      "end": 519.893,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And thus I have spoken.",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 155
    },
    {
      "start": 520.073,
      "end": 520.909,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Amen.",
      "verse": "7:27",
      "lineIndex": 156
    }
  ]
}